{"slug":"contracts-schema-v2","title":"Schema Definition v2 — contract","blocks":[{"id":"b1","type":"ingress","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Source: "},{"type":"text","value":"api/lib/barkpark/content/schema_definition.ex","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":". Full reference: "},{"type":"text","value":"_attic/docs-2026-06/docs/plugins/SCHEMA_V2.md","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" (attic'd). TUI constraint (D12): "},{"type":"text","value":"CLAUDE.md","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" \"Plugin schemas\" section."}]},{"id":"b2","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Four v2 field types"},{"id":"b3","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"All four types appear only in plugin-authored schemas. The eight legacy seed schemas (post, page, author, category, project, siteSettings, navigation, colors) use only v1 primitives and round-trip unchanged via the permanent "},{"type":"text","value":"flat_mode","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" branch."}]},{"id":"b4","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"composite — nested object with named subfields"},{"id":"b5","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Composites recurse arbitrarily deep. The recursive validator ("},{"type":"text","value":"Barkpark.Content.Validation","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":") walks composites with paths shaped "},{"type":"text","value":"/<parent>/<child>","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" and folds path information into the v1-shaped error envelope so existing clients keep working."}]},{"id":"b6","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"arrayOf — homogeneous array with ordered flag"},{"id":"b7","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"ordered: true","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" → up/down reorder buttons in the LiveView field component. "},{"type":"text","value":"ordered: false","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" → unordered set. Drag reorder (Sortable.js + LiveView JS hook) deferred to Phase 1+."}]},{"i